# Slide: turn to face +Z, sprint, then hold crouch. The slide starts faster than the sprint and the camera goes low. Releasing crouch stands the player up before the wall at z = 20.
expect player.position 0.0 0.0 6.0
look 1257 0
hold sprint
hold move_forward
wait 45
state 01-sprinting
hold crouch
wait 3
expect player.sliding true
state 02-slide-start
wait 20
expect player.sliding true
expect player.crouching true
state 03-mid-slide
shot 03-mid-slide
release crouch
wait 3
expect player.sliding false
expect player.crouching false
state 04-stood-up
